</p> </div> </section>  <section class="py-24" style="background: var(--t-bg);"> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16"> <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--t-bg-accent);">Why DuoCircle</span> <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">
The proof, plainly
</h2> <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);">
Third-party-verifiable trust signals plus the operating principles that have run the company since 2014.
</p> </div> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5"> <div class="group relative rounded-2xl p-7 transition-all duration-300" style="background: var(--t-card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--t-card-border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-hover');this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px '+getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-shadow');" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-border');this.style.boxShadow='none';"><div class="absolute top-0 left-6 right-6 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-transparent transition-all duration-300" style="--tw-gradient-via-position: 50%;"></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--t-bg-accent) 7%, transparent);"><svg class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--t-bg-accent);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">SOC 2 Type 2 since 2022</h3><p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);">Audited annually under the AICPA Trust Services Criteria (Security, Availability, Confidentiality, Processing Integrity). Hancock Askew &amp; Co performs the audit. The Bonterms Mutual NDA is published publicly so prospects review it before requesting the report.</p></div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl p-7 transition-all duration-300" style="background: var(--t-card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--t-card-border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-hover');this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px '+getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-shadow');" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-border');this.style.boxShadow='none';"><div class="absolute top-0 left-6 right-6 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-transparent transition-all duration-300" style="--tw-gradient-via-position: 50%;"></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--t-bg-accent) 7%, transparent);"><svg class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--t-bg-accent);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M14.857 17.082a23.848 23.848 0 0 0 5.454-1.31A8.967 8.967 0 0 1 18 9.75V9A6 6 0 0 0 6 9v.75a8.967 8.967 0 0 1-2.312 6.022c1.733.64 3.56 1.085 5.455 1.31m5.714 0a24.255 24.255 0 0 1-5.714 0m5.714 0a3 3 0 1 1-5.714 0"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">Email experts, not sales reps</h3><p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);">When you call DuoCircle, the person on the call is the person who will solve the problem. No SDR funnel, no multi-tier escalation queue. We tell you yes or no quickly. If yes, we get to work.</p></div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl p-7 transition-all duration-300" style="background: var(--t-card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--t-card-border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-hover');this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px '+getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-shadow');" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValu