yle.boxShadow='0 8px 30px '+getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-shadow');" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-border');this.style.boxShadow='none';"><div class="absolute top-0 left-6 right-6 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-transparent transition-all duration-300" style="--tw-gradient-via-position: 50%;"></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--t-bg-accent) 7%, transparent);"><svg class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--t-bg-accent);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M15.75 6a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0ZM4.501 20.118a7.5 7.5 0 0 1 14.998 0A17.933 17.933 0 0 1 12 21.75c-2.676 0-5.216-.584-7.499-1.632Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">Use the free tier as long as it works</h3><p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);">Outbound SMTP, free up to 1,000 emails a month, no card required. DMARC Report covers your first domain. Mail Flow Monitoring has been fully free since 2018. Upgrade when your needs exceed the generous free tier.</p></div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl p-7 transition-all duration-300" style="background: var(--t-card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--t-card-border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-hover');this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px '+getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-shadow');" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-border');this.style.boxShadow='none';"><div class="absolute top-0 left-6 right-6 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-transparent transition-all duration-300" style="--tw-gradient-via-position: 50%;"></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--t-bg-accent) 7%, transparent);"><svg class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--t-bg-accent);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 0 1 3.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 0 0 3 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">Friction-free trust posture</h3><p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);">Pricing on the product sites. SOC 2 reports under a publicly-published Bonterms Mutual NDA. Free tiers wherever they fit. No NDA gauntlet, no procurement runaround.</p></div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl p-7 transition-all duration-300" style="background: var(--t-card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--t-card-border);" onmouseover="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-hover');this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px '+getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-shadow');" onmouseout="this.style.borderColor=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement).getPropertyValue('--t-card-border');this.style.boxShadow='none';"><div class="absolute top-0 left-6 right-6 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-transparent transition-all duration-300" style="--tw-gradient-via-position: 50%;"></div><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-5" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--t-bg-accent) 7%, transparent);"><svg class="w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--t-bg-accent);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 0 1-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 0 0-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 4.5v2.25Z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">Reference calls beat logos</h3><p class="text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);">Most of our enterprise customers prohibit logo use to keep SaaS vendors from leveraging their brands. Those same customers will take a phone call from a serious prospect to vouch for DuoCircle directly.</p></div> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="py-20" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--t-ribbon-bg), var(--t-ribbon-bg-end));"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-ribbon-text);">
Talk to one of our customers
</h2> <p class="text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-ribbon-muted);">
Most of our enterprise customers prohibit logo use to keep SaaS vendors from leveraging their brand. They will, however, take a phone call from a serious prospect to vouch for what we actually do in production. Tell us you're serious and we'll set one up.
</p> <a href="/contact/" class="group inline-block px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-lg font-bold transition-all" style="background: var(--t-btn-primary-bg); color: var(--t-btn-primary-text); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px var(--t-btn-primary-shadow);"> Request a reference call <span class="inline-block ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1">&rarr;</span> </a> </div> </section>  <section class="py-20" style="background: var(--t-bg-subtle); border-top: 1px solid var(--t-border);"> <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"> <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--t-bg-accent);">The standard we hold ourselves to</span> <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold mb-6" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-text);">
Did right by you
</h2> <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--t-text-secondary);"> <p>
When prospects come to us for an evaluation, we give them a fair technical answer. Sometimes that answer is "you don't actually need what we sell." Sometimes it's "the right answer is somebody else, here's why." Sometimes it's "yes, this is a fit, here's how it would work." All three happen, in roughly equal measure.
</p> <p>
The standard we hold ourselves to is simple. If, sometime in the future, a neutral third-party technical expert looks at our recommendation in retrospect, they should be able to say <em style="color: var(--t-text);">"DuoCircle did right by you."</em> That principle outweighs any individual sales conversation.
</p> <p>
The honest "look elsewhere" stance shows up on every product page. We'd rather walk away from a bad fit than sell into one. The customer base we have today, more than 50,000 organizations across twelve years, is built on that operating principle, not in spite of it.
</p> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="py-24" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--t-ribbon-bg), var(--t-ribbon-bg-end));"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-4" style="font-family: var(--font-heading); color: var(--t-ribbon-text);">Talk to an expert about your email infrastructure</h2><p class="text-lg mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto" style="color: var(--t-ribbon-muted);">Same-day response. Real expert on the call. We tell you yes or no quickly, and we&#39;ll point you somewhere better when we can.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center"><a href="/contact/" class="inline-block px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg transition-all shadow-lg" style="background: var(--t-bg); color: var(--t-bg-accent);">Talk to an Expert<span class="ml-2">&rarr;</span></a></div></div></section>   </main> <footer class="bg-[#111827] text-gray-300" data-astro-cid-g6nis24w> <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12" data-astro-cid-g6nis24w> <div class="dc-footer-grid grid grid-cols-2 gap-8" style="--dc-footer-cols: 7;" data-astro-cid-g6nis24w> <!-- Brand column --> <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-1" data-astro-cid-g6nis24w> <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4" aria-label="DuoCircle home" data-astro-cid-g6nis24w> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="h-8 w-8"><rect x="0" y="0" width="40" height="40" rx="8" fill="#5751cd"/><path d="M11 16 L20 12 L29 16 V24 C29 28 25.418 31 20 31 C14.582 31 11 28 11 24 V16 Z" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/><path d="M16 21 L19 24 L25 18" stroke="#4ec1cd" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/></svg><span class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-heading);" data-astro-cid-g6nis24w> <span style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand-accent